[{"answer":"Good morning. Total Insurance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Judy speaking, how may I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I recently shipped my belongings from overseas back here to Australia","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I took out insurance with your company.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Some items were damaged during the move so I need to make a claim.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/5.mp3"},{"answer":"What do I have to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, well first I need to get a few details about this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you give me your name please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. It's Michael Alexander.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. And your address, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/10.mp3"},{"answer":"My old address or my current one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Your current one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/12.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 24 Manly Street, Milperra near Sydney.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/13.mp3"},{"answer":"What was the suburb, sorry?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Milperra.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/15.mp3"},{"answer":"MILPERRA.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, who was the shipping agent, Mr Alexander?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/18.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean the company we used?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, the company who packed everything up at the point of origin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, it was... erm...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/21.mp3"},{"answer":"First Class Movers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/23.mp3"},{"answer":"where were the goods shipped from?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/24.mp3"},{"answer":"China,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/25.mp3"},{"answer":"but the ship came via Singapore and was there for about a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't worry, all of that information will be in the documentation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, the dates.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know when the ship arrived?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/29.mp3"},{"answer":"It left on the 11th of October","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and got to Sydney on the 28th of November.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I need one more thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/33.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a reference number.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It should be in the top right-hand corner of the pink form they gave you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh... let me have a look.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh, yes, here it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 601ACK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I need to take down a few details of the actual damage over the phone before you put in a full report.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you tell me how many items were damaged and what the damage was?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, well four things actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll start with the big things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/43.mp3"},{"answer":"My TV first of all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/44.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a large one... very expensive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Our insurance doesn't cover electrical problems.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/46.mp3"},{"answer":"It isn't an electrical problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/47.mp3"},{"answer":"The screen has a huge crack in it so it's unusable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Any idea of the price to repair it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/50.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I don't think it can be repaired.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/52.mp3"},{"answer":"It will need a new one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll make a note of that and we'll see what we can do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what was the second item?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/56.mp3"},{"answer":"The cabinet from the bathroom was damaged as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/57.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a lovely cabinet, we use it to keep our towels in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/58.mp3"},{"answer":"And what is the extent of the damage?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the back and the sides seem okay","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/60.mp3"},{"answer":"but the door has a huge hole in it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/61.mp3"},{"answer":"It can't be repaired.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm really not very happy about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/63.mp3"},{"answer":"And how much do you think it will cost to replace it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, when I bought it last year, I paid $125 for it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/65.mp3"},{"answer":"But the one I've seen here in Sydney is a bit more expensive,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/66.mp3"},{"answer":"it's $140.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, and what was the third item?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/68.mp3"},{"answer":"My dining room table.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/69.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a lovely table from Indonesia.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/70.mp3"},{"answer":"It must have been very hot inside the container","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/71.mp3"},{"answer":"because one leg has completely split down the middle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/72.mp3"},{"answer":"The top and the other three look okay, thank goodness.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Any idea of the price to repair it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I had an estimate done on this actually because it is a very special table to us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/75.mp3"},{"answer":"They quoted us $200, which is really pricey","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/76.mp3"},{"answer":"so I hope the insurance will cover the total cost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure that will be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/78.mp3"},{"answer":"What was the last item, Mr Alexander?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we have a lovely set of china plates and dishes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/80.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, with matching cups, saucers, the lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/81.mp3"},{"answer":"They were all in the one box which must have got dropped because some plates were broken - six actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/82.mp3"},{"answer":"And can you tell me the replacement value of these?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's hard to say because they were part of a set","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/84.mp3"},{"answer":"but they can be up to $10 each as it's such a good set.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, so that would be around $60 altogether?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/87.mp3"},{"answer":"And is that all of the items?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/89.mp3"},{"answer":"So what do I have to do now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-2-part-1-2023-07-25-20-15-20/90.mp3"}]
